# Deny everything, then allow exactly what server/Dockerfile copies. This
# keeps the build context small and keeps local files (.env, databases,
# virtualenvs) out of it.
*
!server/requirements.lock
!server/src/carapace_server/
!packages/crypto/src/carapace_crypto/
!server/alembic.ini
!server/migrations/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
